    <string name="section_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">The app collects no personal data: no accounts, analytics, ads or crash reporting. Favourites, alerts and settings stay on this phone. Your location, when you allow it, is only used on the phone to compute distances and is never sent anywhere. The backend hands out a functional session cookie that does not identify you.</string>
